<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Buckeye upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Buckeye upgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it upgraded Buckeye Partners L.P. to near-term accumulate from neutral.</p>
<p>-- said it kept Buckeye at long-term accumulate.</p>
<p>-- Buckeye closed Wednesday at 44-1/8.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>	  (( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
